sculpture）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231106/798255194571804672690874.jpeg/gDpT-lvi8pgQ-RKaQRWtGJMeh1PkHpVDNU0zezVNM3s\"/><figcaption>Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231106/798255197176598528298043.jpeg/RLLVl6QGDGHgtwYHj224LI2vsm0W233Dvo5Lwr6OS8I\"/><figcaption>Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231106/798255174152884224368025.jpeg/43e_94l0fuc-J242AWLBWAaBs0lRkloT4_Vr_eP1a_0\"/><figcaption>Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231106/798255176413745152190574.jpeg/XFI5reQbHEZJYe6N8Pg2wc93VHOoGIYSMT7SeDE-0ng\"/><figcaption>Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231106/798255189005701120071523.jpeg/XkXxWTNdyuEHVwalYU5WEk7-2rtj6itdZDRYMWQ0WDE\"/><figcaption>Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231106/798255191140732928058641.jpeg/v_Kfn25-d0OsQzAOUsMErUV25safEnpd6v4TH-r-Ex8\"/><figcaption>Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231106/798255183607369728629185.jpeg/8ixJG89mKSOFogqITt67dyZmJEU2wbdo2E0J6thNCeo\"/><figcaption>Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231106/798255186392518656684139.jpeg/RJZ4CnsCFcQgOoedGZHrsR08sACpOj-i7aJlx-2iZcc\"/><figcaption>Jeff de Boer的貓和老鼠鎧甲作品。（IG@jeffdeboersculpture）</figcaption></figure><p>12小時長途班機上能幹嘛？他狂刪近2萬張照片 達人揭少1動作等於白刪</p><p>AI也會不耐煩？網友驚呼「我的AI突然抱怨了」 網笑翻：不演了</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p><p>「本文內容反映原文作者的意見，並不代表《香港01》的立場。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T08:20:16.732294+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2463,"images":33,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}